Personnel, of the Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming.  Mayor Kaysen advised the sponsors of
the ordinance have requested the ordinance be withdrawn from the agenda.  Following inquiry to
members of the governing body present, and with no objection being raised, Mayor Kaysen
announced the item was being withdrawn from the agenda.
